      "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION auth.email()\n RETURNS text\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE\nAS $function$\n  select nullif(current_setting('request.jwt.claim.email', true), '')::text;\n$function$\n",
